# Secrets. GEMINI_API_KEY lives here locally and as a GitHub Actions secret in
# CI. It must never carry a PUBLIC_ prefix or reach client code — Astro inlines
# PUBLIC_ vars into the shipped bundle.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*

# NOTE: data/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# data/recalls.json is the published state, data/review.json holds ambiguous
# merges awaiting a human, and data/snapshots/ holds the raw government
# responses. All three are committed on purpose: git history is the audit trail
# that lets you tell whether a wrong page came from the government or from the
# model. See docs/design.md §5.
